msgid ""
"Show the DJ in the sidebar. It runs the Claude Code CLI you are signed in "
"to; Spotifast never sees your Claude login."
msgstr ""
"在側邊欄顯示 DJ。它使用你已登入的 Claude Code CLI,Spotifast 不會看到你的 "
