msgid "Ask before changing my library"
msgstr "變更我的音樂庫前先詢問"

#: src/ui/dj.rs:1361
msgid ""
"The DJ asks you to approve each like or playlist change before it happens. "
"Removing songs, renaming and anything the DJ does on its own always ask, and "
"so do notes and scheduled tasks."
msgstr ""
"DJ 會在執行前請你核准每次按讚或播放清單變更。移除歌曲、重新命名以及 DJ 自行執"
"行的任何操作一律需要確認,筆記和排程任務也一樣。"

#: src/ui/dj.rs:1370
msgid "Let the DJ search the web"
msgstr "允許 DJ 搜尋網路"

#: src/ui/dj.rs:1377
msgid ""
"Lets the DJ use Claude Code's own web search to look up music facts. The "
"search words it chooses go to Claude's search; it cannot open pages."
msgstr ""
"允許 DJ 使用 Claude Code 內建的網路搜尋來查詢音樂資料。它選擇的搜尋詞會傳送"
"給 Claude 的搜尋;它無法開啟網頁。"

#: src/ui/dj.rs:1385
msgid "Autopilot"
msgstr "自動駕駛"

#: src/ui/dj.rs:1392
msgid ""
"While Spotifast is open, the DJ tops up the queue when it runs low and "
"reacts to skips. It uses your Claude plan."
msgstr ""
"Spotifast 開啟期間,DJ 會在待播清單快播完時補充歌曲,並對跳過作出反應。會消耗你"
"的 Claude 方案用量。"

#: src/ui/dj.rs:1400
