#: src/ui/dj.rs:1404
msgid "Background model"
msgstr "背景模型"

#: src/ui/dj.rs:1407
msgid ""
"The model for the DJ's own turns (autopilot, scheduled tasks). A smaller one "
"costs less of your plan."
msgstr ""
"用於 DJ 自行發起的回合(自動駕駛、排程任務)的模型。較小的模型消耗的方案用量較"
"少。"

#: src/ui/dj.rs:1447
msgid "DJ model"
msgstr "DJ 模型"

#: src/ui/dj.rs:1448
msgid "Which Claude model the DJ asks for."
msgstr "DJ 使用哪個 Claude 模型。"

#: src/ui/dj.rs:1475
msgid "DJ effort"
