#: src/dj/session.rs:709
msgid "Claude Code is not installed."
msgstr "未安裝 Claude Code。"

#: src/dj/session.rs:710
msgid "Claude Code is not running. Try again."
msgstr "Claude Code 未執行。請再試一次。"

#: src/dj/session.rs:713
msgid "Claude Code stopped unexpectedly. Try again to restart it."
msgstr "Claude Code 意外停止。請再試一次以重新啟動。"

#: src/dj/session.rs:715
msgid "Claude stopped responding."
msgstr "Claude 已停止回應。"

#: src/dj/session.rs:716
msgid "Spotifast is closing."
msgstr "Spotifast 正在關閉。"

#: src/dj/session.rs:717
msgid "The listener stopped the DJ."
msgstr "聽眾停止了 DJ。"

#: src/dj/session.rs:718
msgid "The request failed."
msgstr "要求失敗。"

#: src/dj/session.rs:721
msgid ""
"You are not signed in to Claude. Run `claude login` in a terminal, then try "
"again."
msgstr "你尚未登入 Claude。請在終端機中執行 `claude login`，然後再試一次。"

#: src/dj/session.rs:725
msgid ""
"Claude Code is set to use an API key, not your Claude plan. Spotifast only "
"uses your plan (`claude login`), so it stopped."
msgstr "Claude Code 被設定為使用 API 金鑰，而不是你的 Claude 方案。Spotifast 只使用你的方案（`claude login`），因此已停止。"

#: src/dj/session.rs:729
msgid ""
"That model name is not one Claude Code offers. Pick a model in Settings."
msgstr "Claude Code 不提供該模型名稱。請在設定中選擇模型。"

#. Translators: Keep {reason} exactly as written. It becomes the reason Claude Code gave.
#: src/dj/session.rs:735
#, rust-format
msgid "Claude Code stopped: {reason}"
msgstr "Claude Code 已停止：{reason}"

#. Translators: Keep {details} exactly as written. It becomes what Claude said about the
#. limit, such as when it resets, and may be empty.
#: src/dj/session.rs:739
#, rust-format
msgid "Your Claude usage limit is reached.{details}"
msgstr "已達到你的 Claude 使用上限。{details}"

#. Translators: Keep {error} exactly as written. It becomes the system's error text.
#: src/dj/session.rs:743
#, rust-format
msgid "Could not prepare Claude: {error}"
msgstr "無法準備 Claude：{error}"

#. Translators: Keep {error} exactly as written. It becomes the system's error text.
#: src/dj/session.rs:746
#, rust-format
msgid "Could not start Spotifast's tool server: {error}"
msgstr "無法啟動 Spotifast 的工具伺服器：{error}"

#: src/dj/session.rs:757
#, rust-format
msgid ""
"Your environment sets {names}, which would make Claude Code use that instead "
"of your Claude plan. Spotifast uses only the plan you sign in to with "
"`claude login`, so it will not start Claude while that is set. Remove it (or "
"start Spotifast without it) and try again."
msgstr "你的環境設定了 {names}，這會讓 Claude Code 使用它，而不是你的 Claude 方案。Spotifast 只使用你透過 `claude login` 登入的方案，因此在設定該項期間不會啟動 Claude。請將其移除（或在不帶它的情況下啟動 Spotifast），然後再試一次。"

#: src/dj/session.rs:775
msgid "Run `claude login` in a terminal, then send your message again."
msgstr "請在終端機中執行 `claude login`，然後重新傳送訊息。"

#: src/dj/session.rs:779
msgid ""
"Install Claude Code from claude.com/claude-code, then run `claude login` in "
"a terminal."
msgstr "請從 claude.com/claude-code 安裝 Claude Code，然後在終端機中執行 `claude login`。"

#: src/dj/session.rs:783
msgid "Remove the API key from Spotifast's environment, then start it again."
msgstr "請從 Spotifast 的環境中移除 API 金鑰，然後重新啟動。"

#: src/dj/session.rs:787
msgid ""
"Wait for your Claude usage limit to reset, or pick a smaller model in "
"Settings."
msgstr "請等待 Claude 使用上限重置，或在設定中選擇更小的模型。"

#: src/dj/session.rs:789
msgid "Send your message again to restart Claude Code."
msgstr "重新傳送訊息即可重新啟動 Claude Code。"

#: src/dj/session.rs:802
msgid ""
"Claude Code isn't installed. The DJ uses your Claude subscription through "
"the Claude Code CLI. Install it from claude.com/claude-code, then run "
"`claude login` in a terminal."
msgstr ""
"未安裝 Claude Code。DJ 透過 Claude Code CLI 使用你的 Claude 訂閱。請從 "
"claude.com/claude-code 安裝,然後在終端機中執行 `claude login`。"

#: src/dj/session.rs:814
msgid ""
"Sign in to Claude Code. Run `claude login` in a terminal and sign in with "
"your Claude account. Spotifast never sees your login."
msgstr ""
"請登入 Claude Code。在終端機中執行 `claude login`,並使用你的 Claude 帳號登"
"入。Spotifast 不會看到你的登入資訊。"

